title: "rfs-sre-reallocation: exact reconstruction of Renewable Fuel Standard percentage standards and evaluation of exemption-reallocation timing rules"
type: software
version: 1.0.2
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: BSD-3-Clause
license-url: "https://github.com/AvinGupta-ship-it/rfs-sre-reallocation/blob/main/LICENSE"
abstract: "Exact reconstruction of EPA's 2026-2027 Renewable Fuel Standard percentage standards and of both co-proposed alternatives for reallocating the additional 2025 small refinery exemption volume (91 FR 65699, docket EPA-HQ-OAR-2024-0505), with an uncertainty model built from EPA's published record, a family of timing rules, a historical backtest and carryover-RIN accounting. Code (src/, scripts/, figures/, tests/) is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License; text, figures and derived data (paper/, comment/, docs/, data/transcribed/, data/processed/, results/) are licensed under CC BY 4.0."
